                <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-800 flex items-center gap-2 border-b pb-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-cyan-600"></i> Normative Mare & Sicurezza
                </h3>
                <ul id="regole-generali-lista" class="text-xs space-y-3 text-slate-600">
